@format 1
@id queue.create-saved-audio-work
@title Create audio work from saved plans
@area UI workflow
@entry input
@summary Create audio jobs only for unlocked listed sources with active saved sidecar plans, retain relay batches, and lock accepted sources.
@section I. UI
@tabs Audio
@flow TB
@related queue.create-audio-work, audio.restore-plan

@alias ui = Cadroue.UIShell.PMainArea.LAudio
@alias audio = Cadroue.Application.LAudio
@alias courier = Cadroue.UIShell.PMainArea.LCourier

[input] Add All audio request <input>
- Receive unlocked listed sources, priority, preset, and relay routing @ ui.LAudioAllDescribe(...)
> plans

[plans] Select active plans <decision>
- Read the saved audio plan for each listed source @ ui.LAudioPlanRead(...)
- Skip sources whose saved plan is absent or inactive @ ui.LAudioAllDescribe(...)
? "No active plan remains" > rejected
? "At least one active plan remains" > build

[build] Build and persist jobs <storage>
- Create an audio item per active plan and retain or assign its relay batch @ audio.LAudioItemCreate(...)
- Add all built items with relay lineage and lock only accepted sources @ courier.LCourierScheduleAdd(...)
> result

[result] Saved audio plans queued <output>
= Unlocked listed sources with active saved plans become pending audio work and are locked against resubmission.

[rejected] Nothing queued <output>
= Sources without active audio plans remain unchanged.
